</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-10"><p class="text-h2 font-mistral text-current">Build.</p><p class="text-body-large text-current">Connect your data sources. Orchestrate your business logic. Ship AI that holds up under real conditions.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="-mb-px md:grid lg:grid-cols-1"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-4 md:gap-10 md:p-10 border-b border-border-primary border-r"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="text-h4 font-mistral text-current">Workflows.</p><div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-pretty text-text-secondary"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Orchestrate agentic processes that persist state, retry on failure, and resume automatically.</p></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-full"><div class="relative overflow-hidden group size-full lg:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio: 1882 / 1002;" data-loaded="false"><img src="/_astro/workflows_Z1Mrjh1.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f" srcset="/_astro/workflows_2kPRaD.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 400w, /_astro/workflows_ZIgxNd.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 768w, /_astro/workflows_ZyFwWy.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 1280w, /_astro/workflows_ZjMFEG.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 1920w" onload="this.parentNode.dataset.loaded='true'" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 400px, (max-width: 1024px) 768px, (max-width: 1440px) 1280px, 1920px" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1882" height="1002" class="absolute inset-0 w-full z-2 h-full object-cover group-data-[loaded=false]:opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-in-out"><div style="background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover;" class="group-data-[loaded=true]:opacity-0 duration-500 delay-200 pointer-events-none absolute z-1 top-0 left-0 size-full"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="-mb-px md:grid lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-4 md:gap-10 md:p-10 justify-between items-start border-b border-border-primary border-r"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-start"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 items-start"><p class="text-h5 font-mistral text-current min-h-16 mb-4">Agents.</p><div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-pretty text-text-secondary"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Design AI agents that reason across tools, data, and systems. Define instructions and control behavior before anything reaches production.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-full"><div class="relative overflow-hidden group size-full lg:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio: 1293 / 777;" data-loaded="false"><img src="/_astro/agents_1gMYSc.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f" srcset="/_astro/agents_Z9kBHk.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 400w, /_astro/agents_I1iiF.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 768w, /_astro/agents_2ejuET.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 1280w, /_astro/agents_Za0mSs.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 1920w" onload="this.parentNode.dataset.loaded='true'" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 400px, (max-width: 1024px) 768px, (max-width: 1440px) 1280px, 1920px" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1293" height="777" class="absolute inset-0 w-full z-2 h-full object-cover group-data-[loaded=false]:opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-in-out"><div style="background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover;" class="group-data-[loaded=true]:opacity-0 duration-500 delay-200 pointer-events-none absolute z-1 top-0 left-0 size-full"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 p-4 md:gap-10 md:p-10 justify-between items-start border-b border-border-primary border-r"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-start"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 items-start"><p class="text-h5 font-mistral text-current min-h-16 mb-4">Connectors.</p><div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-pretty text-text-secondary"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Connect to any enterprise data source with built-in or custom con