</span><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:gap-10"><p class="text-h2 font-mistral text-current">Govern.</p><p class="text-body-large text-current">See everything. Control what matters.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="-mb-px md:grid lg:grid-cols-1"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4 p-4 md:gap-10 md:p-10 border-b border-border-primary border-r"><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 items-start"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><p class="text-h4 font-mistral text-current text-wrap">Observability.</p><div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-pretty text-text-secondary"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Visualize every request, response, and decision across multi-step pipelines. Traces, dashboards, and context graphs in real time.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"></div></div><div class="w-full lg:w-4/6 shrink-0 relative"><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-full"><div class="relative overflow-hidden group size-full lg:object-contain" style="aspect-ratio: 1282 / 1002;" data-loaded="false"><img src="/_astro/observability_Z1Sc8Re.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f" srcset="/_astro/observability_Z1oVaBI.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 400w, /_astro/observability_ZFDtM2.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 768w, /_astro/observability_2t71Dc.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 1280w, /_astro/observability_ZTSRVE.webp?dpl=6ad1d7b6946342e26a4d2b4f 1920w" onload="this.parentNode.dataset.loaded='true'" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 400px, (max-width: 1024px) 768px, (max-width: 1440px) 1280px, 1920px" alt loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1282" height="1002" class="absolute inset-0 w-full z-2 h-full object-cover group-data-[loaded=false]:opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-in-out"><div style="background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover;" class="group-data-[loaded=true]:opacity-0 duration-500 delay-200 pointer-events-none absolute z-1 top-0 left-0 size-full"></div></div></div></div></div>